# Blocks of six code lines or more that stand in more than one place
# (tests/structural/block.rs, the ruling of 2026-11-24: duplication is a
# defect, and a part does one job and nothing else). One group per run,
# however long the run: a group that is another group sliding is not
# counted. A copy made raises the count and a copy removed lowers it: both
# fail the run, so this file says what is left to do.
#
# 85 when the scan landed (2026-11-24). 78 on 2026-11-25: the facet built
# four ways in phiecs storage is `Storage::facet` over an `IntoPhasor`
# phasor, the source file read three ways in phient is `sources::text`, and
# the repack on the real axis six families each had is `family::scalar`
# with `family::truth` beside it.
#
# 76 later the same day: the two `Ref` bodies nothing writes any more are
# gone and the three it reads are one `Body<P>`, the bytes held in place by
# `the_written_bytes_are_the_format`.
#
# 68 on 2026-11-27, from one dedup: philog's engine walk, its walk under
# an effort limit and its walk swept from a sector were three copies of
# one walk, differing in where they aim and the words they say themselves
# in - `walk::walk` over a `walk::Aim`, with five tests where the crate
# had none for it. Eight groups, not the one the TODO named: the step
# told and then recorded, the candidate sort, the fold to the shorter way
# round the circle and the answer built from the words went with it.
68
